# V525-H0 — line endings for the composer dispatcher.
#
# `core.autocrlf=true` plus no repository rule let this one file flip from LF
# to CRLF in commit 10f0438b5: the object grew 10,944 CR bytes and a 137-line
# change rendered as ~10,900 lines of churn, while `--ignore-cr-at-eol` showed
# the real diff. Every earlier release stored it with LF.
#
# The rule is deliberately narrow. A repository-wide `* text=auto` would
# renormalize unrelated tracked files in the same commit, which is a much
# larger and less reviewable change than the problem it fixes.
supabase/functions/compose-dialog-segments/index.ts text eol=lf
